---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import PageHero from "../components/PageHero.astro";

const lastUpdated = "September 2026";
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="How Lihengda Global collects, uses and protects information submitted through this website."
>
  <PageHero eyebrow="Legal" title="Privacy Policy" />

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6">
    <div class="prose-body">
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-500">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

      <p>
        This page explains what information Lihengda Global (Ningbo Lihengda
        Machinery Co., Ltd. and Lihengda (Vietnam) International Co., Ltd.)
        collects through this website, and how we use it.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[var(--color-navy)]">What we collect</h2>
      <p>
        When you submit our Request a Quote form, we collect the information
        you enter: your name, email, and any optional details you provide
        such as company, website, country, product category, project stage,
        target volume, price, timeline, processes needed, preferred base,
        message and any file you attach.
      </p>
      <p>
        We also use Google Analytics to understand overall traffic to this
        site — pages visited, general location (country/city level) and
        device type. This is aggregate, not tied to your name or email.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[var(--color-navy)]">How we use it</h2>
      <p>
        We use your enquiry information only to respond to that enquiry —
        to evaluate your project and get back to you. We do not sell your
        information, and we do not share it with third parties for their own
        marketing purposes.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[var(--color-navy)]">Third-party services</h2>
      <p>
        Our Request a Quote form is processed by <a href="https://web3forms.com" class="font-semibold text-[var(--color-steel)] hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Web3Forms</a>, which delivers your submission to us by email. We use <a href="https://analytics.google.com" class="font-semibold text-[var(--color-steel)] hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Analytics</a> for site traffic statistics. Both providers process data under their own privacy policies.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[var(--color-navy)]">Data retention</h2>
      <p>
        We keep enquiry information for as long as needed to respond to you
        and, if we start working together, for the life of that business
        relationship plus normal recordkeeping. You can ask us to delete
        your information at any time — see contact details below.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[var(--color-navy)]">Your rights</h2>
      <p>
        You can ask us what information we hold about you, ask us to correct
        it, or ask us to delete it. Contact us using the details below and
        we'll handle it directly — no automated process.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[var(--color-navy)]">Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about this policy or your data: <a href="mailto:lyman@lihengdaglobal.com" class="font-semibold text-[var(--color-steel)] hover:underline">lyman@lihengdaglobal.com</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
